### List departments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments

### Department summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments/1/summary

### Department members
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments/1/employees

### Create department
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "OPS", "name": "Operations", "location": "Chennai"}

### Search employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees?name=rao&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10&sort=lastName

### Create employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName": "Lena", "lastName": "Paul", "email": "lena.paul@example.com", "jobTitle": "Ops Lead",
 "salary": 120000, "hireDate": "2026-01-05", "departmentId": 1}

### Transfer employee 3 to department 3
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/3/department/3

### Assign manager
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments/1/manager/2
